    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1756">

                <pb facs="1145" n="1029" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1029"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.77/173.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Price to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-02-04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 4, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Panaman President signed, to-day, contract with Hebard and Company, to construct
                    railway in the province adjoining Costa Rica. Cost estimated at million dollars
                    and a half. Details of bond issue left for consultation with State Department,
                    Washington. It is contemplated encumbering income from six million loan in New
                    York City.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Price</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
